{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">素有「最強Body」稱號的劉穎鏇（Tiffany）近日再次向粉絲大派福利。她於社交平台上載了一輯街頭靚相，以一身簡約的背心短褲造型亮相，更特意大玩「跌膊」展現迷人魅力。</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相片中可見，Tiffany大方展露香肩。置身於橘紅色的光影氛圍之下，她擺出多個可愛姿勢，渾身上下宛如散發出耀眼的「女神光」。配合她標誌性的迷人笑眼，瞬間迷倒眾多粉絲。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4afa969e-13ce-4de7-a9c2-0b6a6b65b8be.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026MdQRJUJ10q1785313599.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4afa969e-13ce-4de7-a9c2-0b6a6b65b8be.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1d4f0181-aa5e-48fb-958b-c2e91e534744.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026tWPNn8h4vZ1785313605.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1d4f0181-aa5e-48fb-958b-c2e91e534744.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這輯唯美照片曝光後，隨即引來大批網民「洗版」式留言。粉絲們紛紛大讚她「好靚女」及「真女神」，更有網民直言對她「暗裡著迷」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-31T05:19:16.145079+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}